        "antidad_bili_4=type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\\/\\/app\\.bilibili\\.com\\/x\\/v2\\/feed\\/index,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deezertidal/private/master/js-backup/Script/bilibili_json.js",
        "# 追番页去广告",
        "antidad_bili_5=type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\\/\\/api\\.(bilibili|biliapi)\\.(com|net)\\/pgc\\/page\\/bangumi,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deezertidal/private/master/js-backup/Script/bilibili_json.js",
        "# 直播去广告",
        "antidad_bili_6=type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\\/\\/api\\.live\\.bilibili\\.com\\/xlive\\/app-room\\/v1\\/index\\/getInfoByRoom,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deezertidal/private/master/js-backup/Script/bilibili_json.js",
        "# 动态去广告",
        "antidad_bili_7=type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\\/\\/api\\.vc\\.bilibili\\.com\\/dynamic_svr\\/v1\\/dynamic_svr\\/dynamic_(history|new)\\?,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/deezertidal/private/master/js-backup/Script/bilibili_json.js",
        "# 视频页 / 动态页 Proto 去广告（app2smile）",
        "antidad_bili_8=type=http-response,pattern=^https:\\/\\/app\\.bilibili\\.com\\/bilibili\\.app\\.(view\\.v1\\.View\\/View|dynamic\\.v2\\.Dynamic\\/DynAll)$,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/app2smile/rules/master/js/bilibili-proto.js",
        "# 动态广告（yjqiang）",
        "antidad_bili_9=type=http-response,pattern=^https://app\\.bilibili\\.com/bilibili\\.app\\.dynamic\\.v2\\.Dynamic/DynAll$,requires-body=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yjqiang/surge_scripts/main/scripts/bilibili/bilibili_dynamic.js"
      ],
      "note": "⚠️ 全部为 requires-body=1（需读完整响应体）—— 这是全配置最耗电的一项：「推荐流去广告」每次下拉刷新都要等整个 feed JSON 下载完才能跑 JS。同样**只保留去广告**：已剔除 4K 画质解锁 / 去除统一设置皮肤 / 标签页处理 / 我的页面处理 / 繁体 CC 字幕转换，共 5 条非去广告脚本；「屏蔽IP请求」属隐私不属去广告，也一并剔除。script-path 指向上游 JS 文件（无法内联，体积 27~107 KB），属「远程引用」，上游删文件会静默失效 —— verify.py 会盯这三个地址。"
